From c845ea1b090bbe1227ab7d03280c4dd8b02a1005 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: derek <derek.yates@live.com>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 13:54:06 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat(mla): add GLM_NEXT NVFP4 KV cache

Define a 304-byte no-RoPE GLM_NEXT record with 256 packed E2M1 latent bytes, 32 E4M3 group scales, and an inline per-token outer scale. Extend the cache writer, decode gather, and production-width prefill path while keeping the existing GLM_NEXT FP8 and GLM_NSA NVFP4 records fail-closed and distinct.

Cover int32/int64 writes, a live writer/reader page beyond the signed 32-bit byte boundary, dequantized decode and 2051-wide prefill oracles, CUDA graph replay without allocation, and the existing GLM_NEXT/GLM_NSA regression suites.

Co-authored-by: David Young <davidseanyoung@gmail.com>

